#block(above: 0.42em, below: 0.5em)[
+ Prekosutra - Overtomorrow - The day after tomorrow
+ Uzeti s nogu - To take from the feet - To take by surprise
+ Pustiti vodu - To release water - To flush the toilet
+ Politička stranka - Political party - Political party
+ Otići na more - To go to the sea - To go to the beach\/coast
+ Nema veze - There are no connections - It doesn\'t matter
+ Zvati kola - To call the car - To call for a ride
+ Pod hitno - Under immediately - Urgently
+ Pogledati kroz prste - To look through fingers - To turn a blind eye
+ Ući u zelenu salu - To enter the green room - To die
+ Staviti tačku na nešto - To put a dot on something - To put an end to something
+ Crne oči - Black eyes - Brown eyes
+ Bez uvijanja - Without winding - Without beating around the bush
+ Držati palčeve - To hold thumbs - To keep fingers crossed
+ Skočiti u reku - To jump into the river - To get married
+ Pregršt soli - A handful of salt - A pinch of salt
+ Nebo zna - Sky knows - Heaven knows
+ Uzeti stvar u svoje ruke - To take the thing in your hands - To take matters into your own hands
+ Pogoditi prstom u nebo - To point a finger at the sky - To make an unrealistic guess
+ Služiti kao jaje jajetu - To serve like egg to egg - To be very similar
+ Bez dlake na jeziku - Without hair on the tongue - To speak one\'s mind
+ Padati s nogu - To fall from feet - To be extremely tired
+ Čekati zelenu svetlost - To wait for the green light - To wait for permission
+ Spavati kao zaklan - To sleep like slaughtered - To sleep very deeply
+ Praviti se lud - To make oneself crazy - To pretend not to know something
+ Izaći na kraj - To go out on end - To deal with something
+ Lomiti srce - To break the heart - To upset greatly
+ Držati fige - To hold figs - To wish good luck
+ Uvesti u zabludu - To lead into error - To deceive
+ Ljubiti u pete - To kiss in heels - To be highly respected
+ Gledati kroz prste - To look through fingers - To be lenient
+ Čist kao suza - Clean as a tear - Spotless
+ Popiti kafu - To drink coffee - To socialize over coffee
+ Bez para - Without money - Broke
+ Crvena armija - Red army - Communist army
+ Žuti karton - Yellow card - Warning in sports
+ Plava krv - Blue blood - Aristocratic lineage
+ Crni fond - Black fund - Illegal money
+ Bela kuga - White plague - Declining birth rate
+ Sivi ekonomija - Grey economy - Informal economy
+ Zeleni signal - Green signal - Go-ahead
+ Roza naočare - Pink glasses - Optimism
+ Plavi voz - Blue train - Presidential train
+ Crveno svetlo - Red light - Stop signal
+ Crni ponedeljak - Black Monday - Stock market crash
+ Bela tehnika - White technology - Home appliances
]
